OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPerhaps a damp start for
OL,6,FCaithness but otherwise variable cloud
OL,7,Fwith some bright spells. A few showers
OL,8,Fpossible, these mainly in the west
OL,9,Fwhere they may be heavy, with longer
OL,10,Fdry and sunny spells in the east.
OL,11,FFeeling quite cool.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with showers
OL,14,Faround the west coasts, dry and clear
OL,15,Ffurther east, light winds. Rain
OL,16,Faffecting the Hebrides and western
OL,17,Fareas later in the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
