OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FQuite a fresh feel to the day
OL,6,Fwith rain spreading across all areas,
OL,7,Fsnow on the higher tops. The Hebrides
OL,8,Fand far west seeing a brighter end to
OL,9,Fthe day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FStormy
OL,12,Fover the weekend, rain spreading east
OL,13,Fon Saturday, heavy at times
OL,14,Faccompanied by gales or severe gale.
OL,15,FRain turning showery Sunday. Perhaps a
OL,16,Fbrighter day Monday with lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
